{"title":"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(another_version_of_Solution_3)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (another version of Solution 3)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/9/bc99c3839fc03084cd7658c5b79266a9a7338ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac34x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/0169031c5bcb311f01ffafeec2a389ab874861ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^y = y^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />. The quantity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> can be expressed as a rational number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/6/9d66543320b3b9a1ba69d64d56643a4f5052add5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {r}{s}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"33\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317440729faba2b233a3547c42e9baccad52b82d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/9/bc99c3839fc03084cd7658c5b79266a9a7338ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac34x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/0169031c5bcb311f01ffafeec2a389ab874861ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^y = y^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> and solve.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50df893e785a080bf64ed34e75f43418217f46b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{\\frac34x} = \\left(\\frac34x\\right)^x\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/d/84ddaae34db407e45d3735c4e7ecf3d96d357945.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{\\frac34x} = \\left(\\frac34\\right)^x \\cdot x^x\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/f/a4f31921cb07be5b2211bc66243be9c7b58674c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{-\\frac14x} = \\left(\\frac34\\right)^x\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc0449a1e4335d28dca63537df44953fcdaa66f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{-\\frac14} = \\frac34\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc5f13bd2448739c00ec5b95b5ff07b758da893.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\frac{256}{81}\\]\" width=\"63\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c436027ff23d67b98a81946ea1a117b3f4c019a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = \\frac34x = \\frac{192}{81}\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/4/18494b15a0cae8d1762488c1361cccbd635c30aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + y = \\frac{448}{81}\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/7/5b7e82e7f2494f2f2865c302e1d3c05e560ec4cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[448 + 81 = \\boxed{529}\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We solve in general using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> instead of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/c/2bcddca5092a7ec886294a0561a3f69b682f12d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/3/0333deebec3dfee52b7b690a1b9fed3658502bd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = cx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"11\" />, we have:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d806bc47a9f272be605a24af932316a92ed65fd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{cx} = (cx)^x \\Longrightarrow (x^x)^c = c^x\\cdot x^x\\]\" width=\"239\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<p>Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c112df2a51295df3c201e3c9caf96a2f9b8d413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^x$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd89ab3358358188839d2841965a7c56e436a7af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^x)^{c - 1} = c^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Taking the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />th root, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50c20dd11d5528c3a9c3b03c347cdbfc1cdbeb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{c - 1} = c$\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/defe82a491bc062d85f64b69d1e8cbd4d58030db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = c^{1/(c - 1)}$\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>In the case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/6/286ff62c9f41b5b4f671816c77bf9512da4f388b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9ba8c22f4d8969cc8d3c0654ec288ffc8d4b72b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\Bigg(\\frac34\\Bigg)^{ - 4} = \\Bigg(\\frac43\\Bigg)^4 = \\frac {256}{81}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"220\" height=\"57\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/85889f4f0ad5f47e3cf8d5f4e8a7739dc254d309.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac {64}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"54\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/0/050d2584d7a3870c5f7a41052f973303e8e1ef33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = \\frac {256 + 192}{81} = \\frac {448}{81}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"201\" height=\"38\" />, yielding an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b7b8eabe2c14cac0419ab5dd48c3bf52bf0d1e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$448 + 81 = \\boxed{529}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the logarithm base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> of both sides, we arrive with:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/a/21abf7622f200a98dab3f24a6aae5b2c205deea4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = \\log_x y^x \\Longrightarrow \\frac{y}{x} = \\log_{x} y = \\log_x \\frac{3}{4}x = \\frac{3}{4}\\]\" width=\"327\" height=\"38\" /></center>\n<p>Where the last two simplifications were made since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7abaa3e645fc53a1cffe15bb69b9a14a6f9d7ac6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{3}{4}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />. Then,\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb0f2145072150b5a6cefb8eeed0ca8aadc30efe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{\\frac{3}{4}} = \\frac{3}{4}x \\Longrightarrow x^{\\frac{1}{4}} = \\frac{4}{3} \\Longrightarrow x = \\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)^4\\]\" width=\"285\" height=\"46\" /></center>\n<p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1b59648a9d9af291d4bdaa9612e956a52fab4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"79\" height=\"46\" />, and thus:\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/3/d43be6aefd097e415bc26154289085ca723e9c25.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+y = \\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)^3 \\left(\\frac{4}{3} + 1 \\right) = \\frac{448}{81} \\Longrightarrow 448 + 81 = \\boxed{529}\\]\" width=\"412\" height=\"46\" /> </center>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28another_version_of_Solution_3.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(another_version_of_Solution_3)\">Solution 4 (another version of Solution 3)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (another version of Solution 3)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the logarithm base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> of both sides, we arrive with:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/f/bffa29ac0113e4a094d47742c2c892b5605f333b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = \\log_x y^x \\Longrightarrow \\frac{y}{x} = \\log_{x} y = \\log_x \\left(\\frac{3}{4}x\\right) = \\frac{3}{4}\\]\" width=\"353\" height=\"43\" />\nNow we proceed by the logarithm rule <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12e0a0e69c77bc2eb5f9e243896eb45f01c0988a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(ab)=\\log a + \\log b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"174\" height=\"20\" />. The equation becomes:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/5/f452730676a87763781a2eaa3d6953eb44769229.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_x \\frac{3}{4} + \\log_x x = \\frac{3}{4}\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/2/e029be1b6df84088a2b2e5072b19dda4034cac2a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Longleftrightarrow \\log_x \\frac{3}{4} + 1 = \\frac{3}{4}\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/5/1f536fa5d57df7f1913e13734f2caa2142844d64.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Longleftrightarrow \\log_x \\frac{3}{4} = -\\frac{1}{4}\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cb633bb549853b288e96eccdc905558902383c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Longleftrightarrow x^{-\\frac{1}{4}} = \\frac{3}{4}\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831a0f192eb28ac2a8715e8e17a70eabad61d1f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Longleftrightarrow \\frac{1}{x^{\\frac{1}{4}}} = \\frac{3}{4}\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/a/6caea2c624237893ab4b4b6c9494201352da6056.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Longleftrightarrow x^{\\frac{1}{4}} = \\frac{4}{3}\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f469240ad789a7d077fc9c388f9f4f4161bb19.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Longleftrightarrow \\sqrt[4]{x} = \\frac{4}{3}\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0ba6cae47cf6b5527287b2328bd4f94cd310fe7e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Longleftrightarrow x = \\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)^4=\\frac{256}{81}\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"46\" />\nThen find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> as in solution 3, and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/f/3df89a8c15587d5d5bb178abfad55a8a22a1b019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{529}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I\" title=\"2010 AIME I\">2010 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017222323\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 334/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1786/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 108/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9553/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.604      1 -total\n 58.69%    7.397      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.81%    4.892      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8587:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017222323 and revision id 167938. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}